{
  "id": "1190",
  "title": "Breakfast",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-03-13",
  "synopsis": "Ben confuses signs advertising breakfast.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1190/efcb26a40b54112b80c5f9f70e4d5c3ba1ad7736.mp3?1612529362",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "早点\n\n本：你们中国人真的非常努力！\n丽丽：为什么这么说？\n本：每次我早上出门，都可以看到路边写着“早点”两个大字，告诉那些上班的人早点去上班！\n丽丽：哈哈，本！这个“早点”是早餐的意思，写着“早点”的那些地方是卖早餐的地方，不是要告诉那些上班的人早点去上班。",
    "traditional": "早點\n\n本：你們中國人真的非常努力！\n麗麗：為什麼這麼說？\n本：每次我早上出門，都可以看到路邊寫著“早點”兩個大字，告訴那些上班的人早點去上班！\n麗麗：哈哈，本！這個“早點”是早餐的意思，寫著“早點”的那些地方是賣早餐的地方，不是要告訴那些上班的人早點去上班。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Breakfast"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：你们中国人真的非常努力！",
      "traditional": "本：你們中國人真的非常努力！",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ men zhōng guó rén zhēn de fēi cháng nǔ lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: You Chinese people really are extremely hard working!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：为什么这么说？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：為什麼這麼說？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wèi shén me zhè me shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Why do you say so?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：每次我早上出门，都可以看到路边写着“早点”两个大字，",
      "traditional": "本：每次我早上出門，都可以看到路邊寫著“早點”兩個大字，",
      "pinyin": "běn měi cì wǒ zǎo shang chū mén dōu kě yǐ kàn dào lù biān xiě zhe zǎo diǎn liǎng ge dà zì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "告诉那些上班的人早点去上班！",
      "traditional": "告訴那些上班的人早點去上班！",
      "pinyin": "gào su nà xiē shàng bān de rén zǎo diǎn qù shàng bān",
      "english": "Ben: Every time I leave home in the morning, I can see two big characters  “zaodian” by the side of the road, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. telling those workers to get to work early!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哈哈，本！这个“早点”是早餐的意思，",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哈哈，本！這個“早點”是早餐的意思，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hā hā běn zhè ge zǎo diǎn shì zǎo cān de yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "写着“早点”的那些地方是卖早餐的地方，",
      "traditional": "寫著“早點”的那些地方是賣早餐的地方，",
      "pinyin": "xiě zhe zǎo diǎn de nà xiē dì fang shì mài zǎo cān de dì fang",
      "english": "Lili: Haha, Ben! This “zaodian” means breakfast."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "不是要告诉那些上班的人早点去上班。",
      "traditional": "不是要告訴那些上班的人早點去上班。",
      "pinyin": "bú shì yào gào su nà xiē shàng bān de rén zǎo diǎn qù shàng bān",
      "english": "The places that have “zaodian” written on them are places that sell breakfast."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "They’re not telling workers to get to work early."
    }
  ],
